      "range": [
        "spya-tgnssb",
        "spya-u774u3"
      ],
      "title": "Introduction and Stakes",
      "gist": "Seth frames the question of machine consciousness as an old dream with new urgency, since how we answer it shapes both AI's moral status and our own self-understanding."
    },
