      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "Ethics of Uncertainty",
      "gist": "Because consciousness theories remain contested, nobody should deliberately try to create conscious AI given the ethical disaster it would risk."
    },
